<title>USA: Union Township, N.J., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>Union Township, N.J., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Securities Capital Markets said it won $7.998 million of Union Township, N.J., public improvement bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.96 percent.</p>
